I'm thinking of casting it more as containing various magical formula,
rather than being magical in and of itself.

Because the Necronomicon has been copied and transliterated so many
times, it takes a lot of effort to figure out what a given copy
contains.  Therefore, I think two kinds of invocation actions:
studying the book, to find out what's in it, and using one of the
already discovered powers.  Invoking it too frequently should cause
you to become confused or begin to hallucinate.  The contents should
be randomly generated when the book is created.  I may have to add a
special field to the obj struct to hold the info on what powers the
book has...

What do people think about the ability to discard an artifact.  Is it
better to have it just discard the artifact, or to replace the
sacrificed artifact with a new one?


